        235.6632537841797,
        134.92820739746094
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        143.6708984375,
        513.4721069335938,
        157.02239990234375
      ],
      "text": "This chapter outlines recent novel techniques for diagnosing and confirming TB and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        159.66741943359375,
        513.4029541015625,
        173.0189208984375
      ],
      "text": "their application to children. It also describes the recommended approach to diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        175.6639404296875,
        167.9083709716797,
        189.01544189453125
      ],
      "text": "of TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        200.17047119140625,
        513.4605712890625,
        213.52197265625
      ],
      "text": "Diagnosis of TB refers to the recognition of an active case of TB disease, i.e. a patient",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        216.09799194335938,
        302.73443603515625,
        229.51849365234375
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis with current disease due to M. .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        249.23793029785156,
        325.9954833984375,
        266.09393310546875
      ],
      "text": "3.2\t I  TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.92539978027344,
        253.24473571777344,
        393.58428955078125,
        265.0439453125
      ],
      "text": "ntroduction to diagnosis of in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        273.7867431640625,
        513.4719848632812,
        287.13824462890625
      ],
      "text": "The diagnosis of TB in children relies on thorough assessment of all the evidence derived",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        289.78326416015625,
        513.4489135742188,
        303.134765625
      ],
      "text": "from a careful history of exposure, clinical examination and relevant investigations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        305.77978515625,
        513.4606323242188,
        319.13128662109375
      ],
      "text": "The proposed approach to diagnosing TB in children (discussed in detail below and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        321.707275390625,
        513.46044921875,
        335.1277770996094
      ],
      "text": "(1-4) summarized in Box 1) is based on limited published evidence  , and rests heavily on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        337.77276611328125,
        159.1683807373047,
        351.124267578125
      ],
      "text": "expert opinion.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.89788818359375,
        365.6164245605469,
        433.82586669921875,
        379.83642578125
      ],
      "text": "Guidance on approach to diagnosis of TB in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        365.9044189453125,
        136.89788818359375,
        379.83642578125
      ],
