      "bbox": [
        124.72440338134766,
        514.4264526367188,
        178.5033721923828,
        531.6634521484375
      ],
      "text": "HIV testing",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        520.9318237304688,
        113.19389343261719,
        528.9318237304688
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        558.4598999023438,
        513.4835205078125,
        571.8114013671875
      ],
      "text": "Most children with TB have pulmonary TB. Although bacteriological confirmation of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        574.4563598632812,
        513.41455078125,
        587.807861328125
      ],
      "text": "is not always feasible, it should be sought whenever possible by microscopy, culture or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        590.452880859375,
        510.2173767089844,
        603.8043823242188
      ],
      "text": "WHO-endorsed genotypic (molecular) testing (i.e. Xpert MTB/RIF) of respiratory or non-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        606.4494018554688,
        510.2174377441406,
        619.8009033203125
      ],
      "text": "respiratory samples as indicated by clinical presentation. A trial of treatment with anti-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        622.4459228515625,
        473.1645202636719,
        635.7974243164062
      ],
      "text": "TB medications is not recommended as a method of diagnosing TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        646.8834228515625,
        389.43292236328125,
        660.3038940429688
      ],
      "text": "(5) The key risk factors for TB in children are outlined in Box 2  .",
